The documentation hierarchy is:

```text
000_READ_FIRST.md
        ↓
001_PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS.md
        ↓
002_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md
        ↓
003–008 Technical Specifications
```

`000_READ_FIRST.md` establishes the highest-level V1 boundary.

