`002_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md` defines how those requirements are organized architecturally.

Documents `003–008` define implementation-level details.

No lower-level document may introduce functionality that conflicts with a higher-level document.

If a lower-level document requires a new feature, module, service, or workflow that is not permitted above, the lower-level document must be corrected.

